---
import { AUTOMATION_BRIEF_URL } from "../../../../src/data/site";
---

<section
  class="services page-width section-space"
  id="services"
  aria-labelledby="services-heading"
>
  <div class="service-intro">
    <h2 id="services-heading">
      Start with one<br class="desktop-break" /> recurring task.
    </h2>
    <p>
      A report built by hand. Information copied between systems. A local model
      you need to evaluate. Bring the work you want to change.
    </p>
    <a class="action" href={AUTOMATION_BRIEF_URL}
      >Discuss a workflow <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a
    >
  </div>
  <div class="service-detail">
    <h3>First, establish what will work.</h3>
    <p>
      We map the current process, define a useful result, and identify the
      exceptions that need a person's judgment. Where AI may help, we test it
      against representative examples.
    </p>
    <dl class="scope-list">
      <div>
        <dt>You bring</dt><dd>
          The current steps, tools, and an example input and output.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>You receive</dt><dd>
          A workflow map, feasibility findings, and a recommended build scope.
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Then we decide</dt><dd>
          What to build, where it runs, and how your team will maintain it.
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
    <p class="caption">
      Scope, price, and timing are agreed before work begins.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
